cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you refer to this research portfolio, please cite it."

title: "Onto_PPS: Pediatric Patient Safety Ontology Research Portfolio"

abstract: >
  Research portfolio documenting doctoral research on the development and
  evaluation of a knowledge representation framework for pediatric patient
  safety. The repository presents a high-level overview of the research
  objectives, methodology, workflow, evaluation framework, scientific
  contributions, and associated scholarly outputs. The ontology artifact and
  full doctoral thesis are not publicly distributed in this repository.

